ate":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5790,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:16:48Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-09-21T13:23:46Z","updated_at":"2026-09-22T07:02:55Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":true,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123673","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123673","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123673.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123673.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/2765\r\n\r\nThis PR adds effect sends - bus routing to multiple buses. This allows you to have a \"reverb bus\" and other kind of FX buses. With this it's a lot easier to implement spatial effects for any sound.\r\n\r\nI haven't implemented bi-directional sends yet. So currently its routing is restricted to the buses to the right side of the source bus. The naming is also all over the place. For some reason bus output is called \"send\" so I called mine \"sends\" (yeah, this is horrible). So I would like to get some help with the naming or I could try and convert the output \"send\" to these sends, but in the end the API must have the same method names so I don't really know how to deal with the naming.\r\n\r\nFor now I am marking this as a draft. You can test this if you want. It works both in the editor and in a running game. All of the API for now has \"x_bus_sends_x\" naming convention. I also made it work with StringNames and not with indices from the beginning, so that's up for debate too. I think in this case StringNames have the same problem as indices and until we can have bus resources or some kind of bus handles this will give us (game developers) a lot of problems.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9e414f92-2119-498a-89b8-ed2250ddc209\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nNo AI.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123673/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123673/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}